WEBVTT

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:10.840
Nearly a month had passed since the 
Edward-san incident and it is now summer.

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:14.740
Akane Academy is entering summer break.

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:21.500
So, anyway, camp will be held on a small 
island in Yamaguchi Prefecture this year.

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:23.760
Be well prepared, everyone.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:24.740
Hey.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:27.080
What do we do at summer camp?

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:28.500
Training, I be—

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.300
<b>*Don't try this at home, kids!</b>

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:33.260
Haimura, do you have time after school?

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:35.430
Make time if you don't.

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:40.630
As vice captain, I, Kanzaki Tokiko, 
order you to go swimsuit shopping with me.

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:41.140
What?!

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:48.020
<b>*Don't try this at home, kids!</b>

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:44.350
I'll pick out your swim shorts for you.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:47.460
Disgustingly tight boomerang pants!

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:51.260
Oh, boomerang street!

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:58.130
I'm sure when you think of summer 
at the beach, you think of partying.

00:00:58.130 --> 00:00:59.950
But I expect you all to behave yourselves.

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:01.000
Yes, sir.

00:01:07.990 --> 00:01:13.190
Urushibara, Kanzaki-senpai... I have 
a ton of enemies going after Moroha.

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:15.900
I'm going to beat them all!

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:18.470
With a killer, seductive swimsuit!

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:21.600
Mommy, that person's weird.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:22.970
Don't look.

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:25.480
I heard the news, Shizuno.

00:01:26.010 --> 00:01:29.440
That you're going to the 
beach with Haimura-kun!

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:32.110
These are professional 
designers and stylists.

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:36.910
Find the perfect swimsuit to 
use to seduce Haimura-kun!

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:36.910
Calm down, Nii-san. Think this through.

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:40.970
You could go have a kid 
or two while you're there.

00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:44.100
Giving birth as a student 
isn't without its worries,

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:47.250
but leave everything to your brother.

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:55.710
<b>Fashion Center 
Sumamura</b>

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:55.710
This shop will do.

00:02:01.310 --> 00:02:03.330
Huh? Momo-senpai.

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:04.750
Haimura.

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:09.280
You'd look better in that bikini.

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:11.500
Haimura, you pervert!

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:15.990
A tiny-breasted girl like me? In a b-b-b-bikini?

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:19.990
You'd look good in it. 
After all, you're cute, Momo-senpai.

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:23.850
Liar!

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:26.900
People have been saying Momochi-san's 
daughter Haruka-chan

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:28.660
looks like a boy ever since I was little!

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:31.380
Come on, don't say that.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.080
Go away!

00:02:34.610 --> 00:02:36.510
Enjoy your stay.

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:42.510
Write!

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:47.010
<b>I am homesick indeed, I am homesick indeed.</b>

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:51.510
<b>My hometown, thousands of miles away.</b>

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:52.510
Is this the Principal's?

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:54.420
<b>Oh, unreachable land, I am out of reach. I am hateful indeed.</b>

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:53.730
Yes.

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:56.720
It's a transient gate. Transportal.

00:02:54.630 --> 00:02:58.210
<b>Take my feelings and bind the distance between us.</b>

00:02:56.720 --> 00:03:00.140
It's a precious magic she 
can use only once a day.

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:03.150
<b>Take this spell and bend the space between us.</b>

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:06.530
Well then, everyone, take care.

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:23.970
We're here!

00:04:56.700 --> 00:05:01.400
I love the beach!

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:05.140
She's way too hyper.

00:05:07.650 --> 00:05:08.660
What the?

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:15.660
The waves took my bikini top!

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:18.300
Not bad for Ranjou-san.

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:20.740
Help me, Nii-sama!

00:05:20.740 --> 00:05:22.670
Hide it a little, will you?

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:26.180
No fair, leaving me out of the fun.

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:28.150
The barrier?

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:29.430
Perfect.

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:31.060
Hey.

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:37.280
Senpai, you're letting your 
brand new swimsuit go to waste.

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:38.610
Hey!

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:42.000
How do you know it's a brand 
new swimsuit, Nii-sama?

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:44.030
Well, y'know...

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:45.210
Hide it already.

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:46.570
Don't switch the subject!

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:51.350
I'd like to hear all about it, too.

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:53.580
I'm reading ill fortune with women again.

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:55.540
It's because I...

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:57.250
Don't move.

00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:02.010
What's this about, Taketsuru-senpai?

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:04.010
Watch this.

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:09.670
You worked so hard for you-know-who.

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:10.950
Make sure he sees it.

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:12.800
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:15.020
You look good, Momo-senpai.

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:18.530
What are you doing?

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:20.730
Get a hold of yourself.

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:26.550
<b>*Don't try this at home, kids!</b>

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:25.550
Don't touch me!

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:26.570
Quit swinging them around so much!

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:29.810
You said you wanted to have 
fun at the beach, too, Kanzaki.

00:06:29.810 --> 00:06:32.080
What's with that shabby outfit?

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:34.620
I was banned.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:37.540
I tried so hard to find something 
I could show Haimura,

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:39.430
and the captain caught me and he was like,

00:06:39.430 --> 00:06:43.590
"You look more objectionable in that 
swimsuit than if you were nude. I won't allow it."

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:47.950
The captain is such a stubborn, lame, 
antisocial loner, and he's taking it

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:53.050
out on Haimura and me 
because we're so in love!

00:06:55.150 --> 00:06:58.280
I appreciate your remonstrance, Vice Captain.

00:06:58.710 --> 00:06:59.860
Ow, ow, ow!

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:02.460
Wait, Captain, all I meant was— Ow, ow!

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:04.580
It looks like we're all here.

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:05.910
Stop pressing so hard, 
my head's going to crack!

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:07.030
Let's start training now.

00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:07.310
Not Gorikitsu!

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:09.360
Something's spilling out of my ears!

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:12.580
Is something spilling out of me?

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:13.990
No!

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:18.260
So for this year's camp,

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:20.500
you're each to choose your own challenges,

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:23.780
and complete them by the 
last day of the camp.

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:25.170
That sounds fun.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:26.250
I'm in.

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:29.680
We meet up at the residence at 6 PM.

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:30.820
Don't be late.

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:31.780
Yes.

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:34.980
I've decided.

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:36.810
Decided on what?

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:41.680
My challenge is Momo-senpai.

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:43.710
I'm going to be faster than you.

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:48.480
Uh, why don't you choose another challenge?

00:07:55.760 --> 00:08:00.810
Oh no, Momo-senpai, are you 
intimidated by my prospects?

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:12.530
I-It feels like bullying, I don't like it.

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:21.470
Obviously, I know I can't beat you 
right away. I'm not that arrogant.

00:08:21.470 --> 00:08:24.480
But "bullying" is a bit much, isn't it?

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:28.150
Fine, I'll take your challenge.

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:33.150
All right.

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:34.830
Ready...

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:36.660
Go!

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:48.500
Are you all right?

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.710
O-One more.

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:03.390
Go go, both of you!

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:06.250
She really doesn't know her bounds, does she?

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:08.600
She doesn't even have the basics down.

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:11.360
And she thinks she can beat 
Haruka-oneesan of all people.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:13.360
She's so reckless.

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.870
Hullo, Jack, how've you been?

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.930
Who the heck is Jack?

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:26.290
<i>It's the nickname I gave you, remember?</i>

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:29.640
Because you're so full of surprises, 
like a jack-in-the-box.

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:30.790
Lucky you.

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:34.420
I'm busy with meetings, and Jack's off on

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:35.680
<i>vacation with girls.</i>

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:38.220
How did you even hear about that?

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:41.760
<i>When I was talking to the 
principal on the phone about</i>

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:44.430
the Six Heads meeting we're holding for you.

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:46.780
<i>For me?</i>

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:48.370
Are you curious?

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:49.790
<i>Not really. Bye.</i>

00:09:56.180 --> 00:09:57.730
Yes?

00:09:56.180 --> 00:09:58.410
<i>You're awful, Jack!</i>

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:01.710
What was that?

00:10:01.710 --> 00:10:04.510
That nuisance is being a nuisance again.

00:10:04.510 --> 00:10:06.830
He's nominating me for Rank-S,

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:10.330
but, apparently, the so-called Lightning Emperor of Russia is staunchly against it.

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:11.920
Th-That's dangerous.

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:13.380
Dangerous?

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:18.430
Mari-oneechan always told me the Lightning Emperor of Russia is a really scary person.

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:20.300
It's because of me.

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:23.790
Sir Edward ended up learning 
about your abilities.

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:25.930
That's not your fault, is it, Shizuno?

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:33.640
A-Are you all right?

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:36.490
I'm fine.

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:46.850
<i>After training today, we broke open 
a watermelon with a stick.</i>

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:50.710
<i>After we split the watermelon, 
Moroha-san ate a ton of watermelon,</i>

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:52.900
<i>saying we shouldn't let it go to waste.</i>

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:56.420
<i>Today we had a courage test.</i>

00:10:56.420 --> 00:11:01.550
<i>But compared to the captain and the 
scary vice captain, it was nothing.</i>

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:06.330
<i>Vice Captain kept sneaking into Moroha's 
room at night, and every time,</i>

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:08.100
<i>she'd get caught by the 
captain and he'd lecture her.</i>

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:11.330
Mari I'm glad you made 
a lot of friends, Maya.

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:17.010
<i>Speaking of which, Moroha and Satsuki 
are sneaking out at night together.</i>

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:31.990
Please, Nii-sama.

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:36.570
Coach me so that I can be 
faster than Momo-senpai.

00:11:37.650 --> 00:11:39.520
Why don't you choose a different challenge?

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:42.300
I-I knew it would be difficult.

00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:47.910
But at this rate, I'm just going to 
drag you down, like in my past life.

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:49.310
Calm down.

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:53.470
Don't be in such a hurry, Satsuki.

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:56.260
Hey, come on!

00:11:56.800 --> 00:11:59.570
This is our first time doing this.

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:08.860
I remember.

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:09.700
Huh?

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:14.620
In my memories, Flaga was always fighting.

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:18.590
And I was always being left behind.

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:20.610
Yeah.

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:23.860
I didn't want you to be on the battlefield.

00:12:23.860 --> 00:12:26.310
So you mean to say I'm not reliable.

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:27.190
It's the opposite.

00:12:29.570 --> 00:12:33.980
I knew your hidden talents were extreme.

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:37.600
If they were to surface during battle,

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:41.430
I wouldn't be able to distance 
you from the warzone.

00:12:41.430 --> 00:12:42.610
I couldn't stand it.

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:46.050
I never knew.

00:12:47.170 --> 00:12:52.620
Back during the Edward thing, 
I felt safe leaving you with Angela.

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:55.740
Pathetic, isn't it?

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:57.540
It's not pathetic.

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:58.630
I'm happy.

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:03.730
Knowing that, I'm telling you to give 
up your challenge to beat Momo-senpai.

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:07.600
Momo-senpai specializes in speed.

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:10.440
You could even say speed is all she has.

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:15.360
She knows that all too well, and that's 
why she polishes her Jinsokutsu.

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:19.910
So to say so casually that 
you're going to become faster

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:23.020
than her is to step all over her pride.

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:26.200
I know that, but...

00:13:27.380 --> 00:13:29.650
You have your own fortes, Satsuki.

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:31.520
Work on those, and you'll get stronger—

00:13:31.520 --> 00:13:36.620
Momo-senpai's always your partner 
during training, isn't she, Moroha?

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:43.180
Well, that's because there's no one 
else that can keep up with our speed.

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:48.930
I want me to be your partner.

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:58.700
I can't guarantee I can make you win.

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:01.950
We're training every night from now on.

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:02.660
Can you do it?

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:04.310
Of course, Nii-sama.

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:05.280
Thank you!

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:06.820
Let go!

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:08.470
Hey!

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:20.930
I'm grateful that the Japan branch 
executive himself would come.

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:23.550
I don't hate beautiful people.

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:26.000
I just want to make sure I, Suruga Ando,

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:29.470
get to have you all to myself, 
now that you're here.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:30.470
I'm honored.

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:35.090
As soon as we get to headquarters, 
I'll be taking a Transportal to London.

00:14:35.090 --> 00:14:36.550
Come with me.

00:14:37.420 --> 00:14:38.440
By the way,

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:39.830
Yes?

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:42.130
I heard a rumor that a majority of

00:14:42.130 --> 00:14:46.430
Saviors from around the nation 
will be brought to Tokyo while

00:14:46.430 --> 00:14:48.450
the branch executive is away.

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:49.910
It's true.

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:56.830
I suspect it's only your Rank-A and B 
students that haven't been summoned.

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:10.410
Your barbecue skills are Rank-S, Satsuki!

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:12.250
They're cooked just right.

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:13.320
I'm jealous.

00:15:13.630 --> 00:15:15.970
Leave the cooking to me!

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:18.320
Have you been practicing?

00:15:18.320 --> 00:15:21.600
I wanted Nii-sama to enjoy 
a good meal someday.

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:22.980
I've always been practicing.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:27.050
The principal must be in the 
Six Heads meeting right now.

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:28.460
It's amazing though, isn't it?

00:15:28.460 --> 00:15:32.040
All of the Six Heads are 
gathering for your sake.

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:32.990
Nah.

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:34.500
Haimura!

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:38.580
I heard your Rank-S promotion 
might get canceled.

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:40.570
Too bad for you!

00:15:40.570 --> 00:15:41.390
Right.

00:15:41.910 --> 00:15:46.180
Well, you can get a fresh start 
from now on as my errand boy.

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:48.940
Why am I set to be your errand boy?

00:15:48.940 --> 00:15:51.330
Because you're the junior here.

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:54.900
That's how it's always been, 
since time immemorial.

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:58.270
So were you the errand boy last 
year, then, Kammie-senpai?

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:01.880
Shut up, leave me alone.

00:16:01.880 --> 00:16:05.690
That kid didn't come to last year's camp.

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:06.520
Huh?

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:09.000
He wasn't even a reserve yet.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:12.320
Kammie-senpai.

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:13.410
<b>*Don't try this at home, kids!</b>

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:15.920
More importantly, 
are you eating well, Haimura?

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:18.030
We're going sunbathing together tomorrow.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:21.620
You're going to be all over my entire body...

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:24.530
You're going to make him 
spread sunblock on you?

00:16:25.390 --> 00:16:27.760
Do you think I'd be so cliché?

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:29.010
You insult me!

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:31.630
It's grown-up lotion I 
want him to lather on me!

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:33.840
What the hell are you thinking?

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:34.840
<b>*Don't try this at home, kids!</b>

00:16:35.150 --> 00:16:38.150
Nothing but pervy things, of course.

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:40.560
I love meat.

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:43.310
It stimulates the soul 
and heightens the libido.

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:44.850
What the hell are you talking about?

00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:50.190
My ass meat is good, too, Haimura.

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:52.070
That's a terrible picture.

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:54.070
Come on, let's go now.

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:57.300
Your ass is mine, my ass is yours.

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:59.790
Stroke it, knead it, suck on it, bite it,

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:03.830
ravage it with animalistic urges 
and have your way with it.

00:17:06.010 --> 00:17:10.790
When are you going to understand 
what I'm telling you, Kanzaki-kun?

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:12.590
Ow, ow, ow!

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:14.300
Okay, everyone.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:15.730
We have self-guided training tomorrow.

00:17:16.170 --> 00:17:18.550
Work hard towards your goals.

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:20.570
Okay.

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:21.660
My head's going to crack.

00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:25.160
Oh, is my ass a crack?

00:17:25.790 --> 00:17:27.060
Stop playing dumb!

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:39.280
Ten meters, maybe.

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:41.910
That's it?

00:17:42.970 --> 00:17:47.270
Momo-senpai could run a few hundred 
meters on the water without stopping.

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:49.520
O-Once more, Nii-sama.

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:52.380
Listen, take it easy.

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:53.840
Be natural.

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:55.850
I don't mind you being 
pumped up on the inside.

00:17:55.850 --> 00:17:59.430
In fact, be strong of will, but calm of mind.

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:00.680
I'll try it.

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:07.390
Are you okay?

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:10.020
I'm okay.

00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:13.980
<i>I want to be beside Nii-sama always.</i>

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:15.940
<i>I can't give up now.</i>

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:18.400
What are we going to do?

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:20.820
I'll let her borrow Moroha for a while.

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:23.550
Out of consideration for 
Ranjou-san's futile efforts.

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.380
Come on, get a grip.

00:18:31.430 --> 00:18:33.320
Thanks, Nii-sama.

00:18:35.790 --> 00:18:36.930
What's wrong?

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:41.430
Don't you get a weird 
feeling from over there?

00:18:42.240 --> 00:18:43.690
I don't see anything.

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:47.310
Maybe it was just a cold breeze.

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:53.380
Maybe I'm just imagining things.

00:18:53.380 --> 00:18:55.990
Or I got the chills from being cold.

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:57.920
Maybe we should call it a day.

00:18:57.920 --> 00:18:58.940
Okay.

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:10.930
<i>The fun days are going by so fast.</i>

00:19:10.930 --> 00:19:14.530
<i>Summer camp is only two more days.</i>

00:19:15.890 --> 00:19:17.380
Fire!

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:23.990
Fire!

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:25.550
Fire!

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:31.460
Maya-chan, do you like sparklers?

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:32.830
Yes.

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:36.820
When I awakened

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:41.470
to the memories of my past life, 
at first, I was really scared.

00:19:41.470 --> 00:19:46.450
I didn't know which was the real me, 
the one in the past or the one now.

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:49.630
I couldn't stop crying.

00:19:50.930 --> 00:19:56.300
But Mari-oneechan told me 
while we were doing fireworks.

00:19:56.300 --> 00:20:00.310
I'm the same Maya in the past 
life and in the current life.

00:20:00.310 --> 00:20:04.270
I have the same soul. I'm the same person.

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:08.810
The principal's pretty awesome.

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:10.610
She is.

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:12.840
You! Who do you think bought those fireworks?

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:16.920
Don't go raising the roof 
without Kammie-sama here!

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:21.490
How could you young'uns sit 
around with sparklers?

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:23.550
You're way too dried up!

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:27.450
Payback for my pent-up anger! Fire!

00:20:24.470 --> 00:20:27.430
<b>*Don't try this at home, kids!</b>

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:28.870
Wait, wait!

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:31.680
Let's go, Haimura.

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:33.410
It's our memorable first night!

00:20:33.410 --> 00:20:34.600
There're kids here.

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:37.400
You could be a little more 
indirect about it, Kanzaki.

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:41.090
Why don't you go talk to the 
girls about cabbage patches, then?!

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:46.300
My beautiful ass!

00:20:46.320 --> 00:20:50.790
<b>*Don't try this at home, kids!</b>

00:20:46.880 --> 00:20:49.300
Kanzaki-senpai spotted ahead!

00:20:49.300 --> 00:20:51.590
Payback for my pent-up anger! Fire!

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:52.730
Kanzaki!

00:20:56.090 --> 00:20:58.150
I take that as a declaration of war.

00:20:58.710 --> 00:21:00.440
Bring it on, little girls!

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:02.620
I'll burn you all!

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:03.590
Write!

00:21:04.340 --> 00:21:05.410
What the hell?

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:07.020
Dude, Haimura!

00:21:07.020 --> 00:21:08.620
Our fireworks are down to half.

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:10.130
Go get some more!

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:12.580
Fine, I'll do it.

00:21:24.350 --> 00:21:26.560
Shizuno, you're pretty late.

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:29.740
I took a while to get changed.

00:21:29.740 --> 00:21:30.430
Huh?

00:21:34.840 --> 00:21:38.520
Nii-san forced me to bring this.

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:41.390
Did I do the right thing wearing it here?

00:21:42.270 --> 00:21:45.200
I have errands to run for Kammie-senpai.

00:21:45.490 --> 00:21:47.860
We're finally alone.

00:21:49.430 --> 00:21:53.660
Since it's a yukata, 
I'm not wearing any underwear.

00:21:53.890 --> 00:21:56.170
Put it in my cleavage, and whee!

00:21:56.170 --> 00:21:58.200
Stop it!

00:21:59.150 --> 00:22:01.490
F-Fine.

00:22:01.490 --> 00:22:03.310
Let's hang out for a while.

00:22:14.650 --> 00:22:18.360
Sorry I couldn't spend 
too much time with you.

00:22:19.110 --> 00:22:22.280
Camp was more fun than I thought.

00:22:23.280 --> 00:22:24.850
Yeah.

00:22:24.850 --> 00:22:28.960
I want to bring Auntie and them sometime.

00:22:29.480 --> 00:22:33.040
Oh, I hope you invite me, then, too.

00:22:35.420 --> 00:22:37.290
With my family?

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:38.470
Yes.

00:22:38.470 --> 00:22:39.790
I hope you introduce me to them.

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:42.320
Introduce you? You're not—

00:22:43.470 --> 00:22:45.420
But in the meantime...

00:22:52.890 --> 00:22:56.390
Let's have all the fun we can tomorrow.

00:23:00.990 --> 00:23:03.180
Yeah, you're right.

00:23:10.060 --> 00:23:13.990
<i>Fireworks in the night, lighting up 
and then burning out fleetingly.</i>

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:17.700
<i>It was like the passing of the summer days.</i>

00:23:38.910 --> 00:23:48.800
<i>And we hadn't known at the time that 
there was another light in the night sea.</i>

00:23:48.800 --> 00:23:51.110
Hey, let's get started.

00:23:51.110 --> 00:23:52.160
All right.

00:24:11.110 --> 00:24:15.040
<b>*Some of the acts depicted in the episode were dangerous. 
Do not imitate them under any circumstances.</b>

00:24:15.050 --> 00:24:24.930
<b>Preview</b>

00:24:15.620 --> 00:24:18.020
Huh? There isn't really a secret to my speed.

00:24:18.020 --> 00:24:20.770
Teach me how to reduce drag on your chest.

00:24:20.770 --> 00:24:25.400
Next time, episode six: 
"We Are the Swords of Salvation."
